Z||000011||DrRodey||02-03-2001||12:37 AM||||Between me, my family, and my friends and their families.. I've seen preaty much every type of engine and truck there is.  When it comes right down to it, When you need a Strong Reliable Power horse of an engine Ford is the only way to go.  Thats one reason they always were chosen as "farm trucks".  They have plenty of power, and you never have to fix them.  Perfect for the person who wants something that will last them even though they put a lot of strain on it.    <BR>Chevey always spent too much time worrying about the way they looked they never had time to do anything decent with the engine.  <BR>Dodge, They are extremely good pieces of equipment, too bad you have to be rich to own one. ||||reg||1
